  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Nobody knows "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "why"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Betty has become so forgetful in recent years."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "没有人知道为什么近年来贝蒂变得如此健忘。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "why 是常考单词，常出现在对划线部分提问的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要掌握其用法：当线划在 because 部分或 to do 表示目的的部分，要用 Why/What … for 提问。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：He always has a headache "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "because he always goes to bed too late"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ".（对划线部分提问）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "Why"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " does he always have a headache? 为什么他总是头疼？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "She got up early "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "to catch the first bus"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ".（对划线部分提问）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "Why"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " did she get up early? 她为什么起得这么早？"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
